<h2 class="doc-h2">Responsive Layout</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    A container query, not a viewport one — so a field in a narrow sidebar stacks while the same
    field in the page beside it does not.
</p>
<Example Source="FieldResponsive.razor"><FieldResponsive /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Form</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>up-validate</code> checks a field as it is left, without a page load. Guard the handler
    with <code>IsUpValidating()</code> before any write — Unpoly fires it on blur, and without the
    guard every blur would create a record.
</p>
<Example Source="FieldForm.razor"><FieldForm /></Example>

